APPROACHES.md-18-2. All three agree the tried core — GGV corner farm, Sigray sheet books, formal-germ D-series — is a necessary-condition mill stuck on the same two gaps: **no landing theorem and no topological-degree ceiling** (Fable's G1/G2/G5 = Grok's REDUCTION.md audit = Sol's "two global bridges").
APPROACHES.md-19-3. The strip/residue-ODE result (S5–S6/G3) is the campaign's one real theorem; scope-limited, and the ODE rigidity has Żołądek A.7 priority.
