One important scope correction survived the audit: the survey’s undefined “\(N\) places” cannot be replaced by Sigray’s \(td-1\) critical-value-vertex budget. Those count different objects (the degree-6 residue case already separates them sharply). So the main census will report explicit witness upper bounds, but it will not invent an \(N\)-filter.
