+~~~text
+command -v gap                         -> no output
+Python sageall/libgap imports          -> unavailable
+brew --version                         -> Homebrew 6.0.18
+HOMEBREW_NO_AUTO_UPDATE=1 brew search '/^gap$/'
+                                      -> no formula or cask in active taps
