+No installation was attempted. The requested fallback is a self-contained
+pure-Python implementation using the official GAP PrimGrp low-degree data.
+The group IDs, names, orders, and generators were transcribed from
+[data/gps1.g](https://github.com/gap-packages/primgrp/blob/9f8efb2cc5ef6baee485bed87004e66ce1f4410f/data/gps1.g), pinned at Git blob
+9f8efb2cc5ef6baee485bed87004e66ce1f4410f. The current official
