+| 8 | \((3,3,1,1)\) | \(8P2,8P3,8P4,8P5,8P6,8P7\) |
+| 9 | \((8,1)\) | \(9P4,9P5,9P7,9P11\) |
+| 9 | \((6,3)\) | \(9P2,9P5,9P7,9P11\) |
