+63 entry-filtered group/profile Hurwitz rows: PASS
+11 uniform S_d genus-zero profile controls: PASS
+Orevkov boundary control: A9, order 181440, genus 0, PASS
+residue-A control: S6, order 720, genus 18, PASS
