+
+For completeness, the raw-only incidences removed by the singleton entry
+filter are:
+
+| \(td\) | Raw-only profile | Groups containing it |
+|---:|---|---|
+| 6 | \((6)\) | \(6P2,6P4\) |
+| 6 | \((4,2)\) | \(6P3,6P4\) |
